{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07578","headline":"有竹一篇七章 · 萧颖士","name":"有竹一篇七章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有竹斯竿，于阁之前。\n君子秉心，惟其贞坚兮。\n有竿斯竹，于阁之侧。\n君子秉操，惟其正直兮。\n彼蔚者竹，萧其森矣。\n有开者合，宛其深矣。\n回檐幽砌，如翼如齿。\n冬之霄，霰雪斯瀌。\n我有金鑪，熺其以歊。\n夏之日，炎景斯郁。\n我有珍簟，凄其以栗。\n彼纷者务，体其豫矣。\n有旨者酒，欢其且矣。\n友僚萃止，跗蕚载韡。\n彼美公之姓兮，那欤应积庆兮，期子惟去之柄兮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}